      "text": "Haaaaahhhh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 13.4,
      "end_time": 15.0,
      "text": "W-wait a minute!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 15.4,
      "end_time": 17.0,
      "text": "GRRRUOOOOGHHH!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 17.3,
      "end_time": 18.0,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 23.0,
      "end_time": 24.3,
      "text": "GGYYYAAARRGHH!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 24.5,
      "end_time": 27.0,
      "text": "RRRGGHHHH!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 29.3,
      "end_time": 30.3,
      "text": "Aaaaghhhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 36.2,
      "end_time": 37.3,
      "text": "Ohhh man..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 38.0,
      "end_time": 41.3,
      "text": "That was a bigger kaboom than I thought..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 42.2,
      "end_time": 44.3,
      "text": "Our golden gooseberry~!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 45.3,
      "end_time": 49.1,
      "text": "The Mandragora's scream was as deafening as the tales say..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 49.8,
      "end_time": 53.0,
      "text": "I believe we may just have had quite the rare experience."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 53.2,
      "end_time": 56.4,
      "text": "Who needs experience?! It's cash we're after!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 56.5,
      "end_time": 59.2,
      "text": "Our ticket to untold riches exploded into a billion pieces!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 61.0,
      "end_time": 63.9,
      "text": "Not a single scrap left... Guess that's that, huh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 64.1,
      "end_time": 65.2,
      "text": "G-guys, are you all right?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 66.0,
      "end_time": 67.2,
      "text": "We're just dandy."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 68.2,
      "end_time": 71.2,
      "text": "Aside from our ambitions of fortune, that is..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 72.2,
      "end_time": 73.1,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 73.2,
      "end_time": 74.1,
      "text": "Ambitions of fortune?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 75.0,
      "end_time": 75.3,
      "text": "Eh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 75.4,
      "end_time": 76.2,
      "text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 76.3,
      "end_time": 79.4,
      "text": "Uhhh...! Good question! What's all this about, huh, Chieru?"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 79.5,
      "end_time": 80.1,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 80.2,
      "end_time": 82.0,
      "text": "Ummm, ahhh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 82.1,
      "end_time": 84.4,
      "text": "I don't have the teensiest clue what you're talking about!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 85.1,
      "end_time": 87.1,
      "text": "You should ask Yuni! She knows everything!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 87.3,
      "end_time": 90.2,
      "text": "...We were merely hoping to secure"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 90.3,
      "end_time": 94.4,
      "text": "a valuable research sample for the sake of prosperity in Landosol."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 95.1,
      "end_time": 97.4,
      "text": "Hahahahahaha..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 98.0,
      "end_time": 100.3,
      "text": "U... ummm..."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 100.4,
      "end_time": 101.4,
      "text": "Research...?"
    }
  ],
